    "code": "E3",
    "name": "Follow up, no response after enquiry",
    "subject": "Here when you are ready, Brighter Future Mediation [{{case_ref}}]",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>Hello {{client_first_name}},</p><p><br></p><p>I hope this email finds you well.</p><p><br></p><p>I am writing to follow up on our recent communication about booking a MIAM. We understand that life can feel overwhelming, particularly when navigating separation, and it is not always the right time to take the next step.</p><p><br></p><p>As we have not heard back from you, I wanted to let you know that we are here if and when you are ready. There is no pressure to proceed if now is not the right time, and we completely understand if your circumstances have changed or you have decided to explore other options. You can find out more information on mediation and the process <a href=\"{{link_home}}\">here</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>If you would like to go ahead, simply reply to this email or call us on 0333 240 8038. We offer same-day appointments and our MIAMs are fully online.</p><p><br></p><p>If it helps, our <a href=\"{{link_faq}}\">FAQs</a> and our guide to <a href=\"{{link_miam_blog}}\">what a MIAM is</a> explain the process with no commitment either way.</p><p><br></p><p>If mediation is not the right fit at the moment, that is absolutely fine too, and we will close your case for now. Wishing you all the best.</p>",
