    "subject": "Your held MIAM appointment, Brighter Future Mediation [{{case_ref}}]",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>Hello {{client_first_name}},</p><p><br></p><p>I hope this email finds you well.</p><p><br></p><p>I am writing to follow up on your MIAM appointment. As we have not heard back from you, we are unable to continue holding this appointment, and the calendar invitation has been cancelled.</p><p><br></p><p>There is no pressure to proceed if now is not the right time. If you would like to rebook, simply reply to this email or call us on 0333 240 8038 (CRM build - will say book here - with hyperlink). We offer same-day appointments and our MIAMs are fully online. You can find out more about MIAMs and mediation <a href=\"{{link_miam_blog}}\">here</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>If mediation is not the right fit at the moment, that is absolutely fine too, and we will close your case for now. We are always here if we can help in the future.</p><p><br></p><p>Our <a href=\"{{link_faq}}\">FAQs</a> and our <a href=\"{{link_resources}}\">useful resources</a> page are there whenever you need them.</p>",
