    "code": "E5",
    "name": "Free 20 minute consultation, follow up",
    "subject": "Following our conversation, Brighter Future Mediation [{{case_ref}}]",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>Hello {{client_first_name}},</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for taking the time to speak with me today. I hope it was useful to talk things through. You can find out more about MIAMs and mediation <a href=\"{{link_whatis}}\">here</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>As discussed, {{one_line_summarising_what_they_need}}. The next step is a MIAM, a confidential one-to-one online session of up to one hour with an FMC-registered mediator.</p><p><br></p><p>We have the following appointments available:</p><p><br></p><p>{{date_1}}: {{times}}</p><p><br></p><p>{{date_2}}: {{times}}</p><p><br></p><p>{{date_3}}: {{times}}</p><p><br></p><p>Payment</p><p><br></p><p>Fees are payable in advance. Your appointment is confirmed only once payment has been received.</p><p>Payment must reach us at least 72 hours before the appointment, or the held slot is released as per our <a href=\"{{link_terms}}\">terms of use</a>.</p><p>Our current fees are always on our <a href=\"{{link_fees}}\">fees page</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Just reply with the time that suits and I will send the invoice and your calendar invitation.</p><p><br></p><p>In the meantime, our <a href=\"{{link_faq}}\">FAQs</a> and our article on the <a href=\"{{link_benefits}}\">benefits of family mediation</a> may be useful.</p><p><br></p><p>Stage 2. MIAM</p>",
