    "bodyHtml": "<p>Hello {{client_first_name}},</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for choosing Brighter Future Mediation. We know conflict can be difficult and we aim to make the process as simple and efficient as possible, and to keep you fully informed along the way.</p><p><br></p><p>As per our recent communication, we have placed an appointment on hold for your MIAM , and you should have received an invoice by email.</p><p><br></p><p>Payment</p><p><br></p><p>Fees are payable in advance. Your appointment is confirmed only once payment has been received.</p><p>Payment must reach us at least 72 hours before the appointment, or the held slot is released as per our <a href=\"{{link_terms}}\">terms of use</a>.</p><p>Our current fees are always on our <a href=\"{{link_fees}}\">fees page</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Once payment is received your calendar invitation will be updated with your meeting link.</p><p><br></p><p>You can find out more about MIAMs and mediation <a href=\"{{link_faq}}\">here</a>. Do reach out if you have any further questions.</p><p><br></p><p>Our <a href=\"{{link_faq}}\">FAQs</a> and <a href=\"{{link_resources}}\">useful resources</a> are also there if you would like to read more before your appointment.</p>",
