    "subject": "Calendar description, MIAM with Davina",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>Your MIAM (Mediation Information and Assessment Meeting) with Brighter Future Mediation.</p><p><br></p><p>Duration: up to one hour, fully online.</p><p><br></p><p>Mediator: Davina</p><p><br></p><p>Please join your session using this <a href=\"{{zoom_davina}}\">Zoom meeting link</a></p><p><br></p><p>Meeting ID: 816 6134 1329</p><p><br></p><p>Passcode: 125063</p><p><br></p><p>Before you join:</p><p><br></p><p>Join showing your first name only, to protect confidentiality.</p><p>Join from a private space where you cannot be overheard. No children or third parties present or within hearing distance.</p><p>If you are more than 15 minutes late the appointment is marked as missed and rescheduling and repayment may be required.</p><p>Use a stable connection and check your camera and microphone first. <a href=\"{{link_zoom_guide}}\">Zoom guide</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Cancellation: with less than 72 hours notice the full session fee remains payable, as per your agreement to mediate and our <a href=\"{{link_terms}}\">terms of use</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Questions? Reply to your confirmation email or call 0333 240 8038.</p><p><br></p><p>More about MIAMs and mediation: <a href=\"{{link_miam}}\">brighterfuturemediation.co.uk/need-a-miam</a></p><p><br></p><p>Safeguarding: if at any point you feel unsafe or experience abuse, please call the National Domestic Abuse Helpline on 0808 2000 247.</p><p><br></p><p>Kind regards,</p><p><br></p><p>The Client Care team</p><p><a href=\"{{link_home}}\">Brighter Future Mediation</a></p><p>0333 240 8038</p>",
