    "name": "Calendar description, session with Manpreet",
    "subject": "Calendar description, session with Manpreet",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>Your joint mediation session with Brighter Future Mediation.</p><p><br></p><p>Duration: {{duration}}, fully online.</p><p><br></p><p>Mediator: Manpreet</p><p><br></p><p>Please join your session using this <a href=\"{{zoom_manpreet}}\">Zoom meeting link</a></p><p><br></p><p>Meeting ID: 835 8771 0068</p><p><br></p><p>Passcode: 895704</p><p><br></p><p>All sessions begin as shuttle, with each client in a separate breakout room, for a brief touch base with the mediator.</p><p><br></p><p>Before you join:</p><p><br></p><p>Join showing your first name only.</p><p>Join from a private space where you cannot be overheard.</p><p>If you are more than 15 minutes late the session is marked as missed and rescheduling and repayment may be required.</p><p>Use a stable connection. <a href=\"{{link_zoom_guide}}\">Zoom guide</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Cancellation: with less than 72 hours notice the full session fee remains payable, as per your agreement to mediate and our <a href=\"{{link_terms}}\">terms of use</a>. Government vouchers do not cover missed or late-cancelled sessions.</p><p><br></p><p>Safeguarding: if at any point you feel unsafe or experience abuse, please call the National Domestic Abuse Helpline on 0808 2000 247. We can also support a shuttle or hybrid format if you need it.</p><p><br></p><p>Kind regards,</p><p><br></p><p>The Client Care team</p><p><a href=\"{{link_home}}\">Brighter Future Mediation</a></p><p>0333 240 8038</p><p><br></p><p>Stage 4. Second session onwards</p>",
