    "bodyHtml": "<p>Hello {{client_first_name}},</p><p><br></p><p>Here is {{document_name}}, as requested: {{document_link}}.</p><p><br></p><p>{{one_line_saying_what_it_is_for_and_anything_the_client_needs_to_do_with_a_date_i}}</p><p><br></p><p>Please do let us know if you need any further information or support.</p><p><br></p><p>Stage 8. Court and express packages</p>",
    "guidance": "Any time admin sends a document that is not covered by another template. Short and safe.",
